  "logline": "A young woman unexpectedly meets the person who assulted her years ago. Driven by revenge fantasies she crosses the line of what is right and what is wrong.",
  "synopsis": "A traumatised young woman meets her offender years after the assult. He doesn't remember her which is when she sees a chance for revenge. She lures him into her flat and offers him some wine. Slowly we realise that not everything we see is real and start wondering: what is fantasy and what reality?",
